OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FSunny spells and mostly dry to
OL,6,Fstart, with isolated coastal showers.
OL,7,FCloud increasing through the day, with
OL,8,Fa few light inland showers possible in
OL,9,Fthe afternoon. Breezy to start,
OL,10,Fespecially near coasts, then winds
OL,11,Ffalling light.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FAny lingering showers soon
OL,14,Fclearing this evening. Becoming dry
OL,15,Fwith some clear spells. Light winds
OL,16,Fthroughout. Feeling rather chilly,
OL,17,Fespecially in rural spots.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
