OL,3,GEast
OL,4,
OL,5,CThursday:FA dry and bright but mostly
OL,6,Fcloudy day. Cloud will thicken into
OL,7,Fthe evening as outbreaks of rain
OL,8,Fspread eastward on a freshening breeze.
OL,9,
OL,10,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FSunny
OL,11,Fintervals and the odd shower possible
OL,12,FFriday. Dry and bright Saturday, rain
OL,13,Flater. Cloudy with outbreaks of rain
OL,14,FSunday, drier later. Temperatures
OL,15,Ftrending a little above average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
